+// Read-only Odyssey base 1.0.0 route observation. Original main build:
+// 3ca12dfaaf9c82da064d1698df79cda1. See native-route-observer.md.
+// Install after module loading. Capture ONLY on the game thread after a full
+// simulation update and before presentation interpolation. JSON is cache-only.
